{"v":1,"path":"/Components/IPipelineManager/IPipelineManager.html","title":"DJI Mobile SDK Documentation","mainClass":"site-main","tocClass":"site-toc","mainHtml":"\n        <div id=\"ifm-overview\" class=\"article ifm-page\" data-prerender=\"overview members methods\"><div class=\"article\" style=\"display: none;\"><h1><font color=\"#AAA\">class </font>IPipelineManager</h1></div>\n<figure class=\"highlight java\" style=\"display: none;\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">interface</span> <span class=\"title class_\">IPipelineManager</span> </span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>包：</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">dji.v5.manager.interfaces</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<nav class=\"ifm-breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"面包屑\"><span>Common APIs</span><span class=\"ifm-breadcrumb-sep\">›</span><span aria-current=\"page\">IPipelineManager</span></nav><div class=\"ifm-eyebrow\" id=\"ifm-overview\"><span class=\"ifm-badge ifm-kind-badge\">class</span><span class=\"ifm-badge ifm-since-badge\">Since MSDK 5.3.0</span></div><h1 class=\"ifm-title\">IPipelineManager</h1><p class=\"ifm-lead\">SDK互联互通管理类。可通过此类建立MSDK和PSDK设备之间连接的管道，用于MSDK和PSDK设备之间传输数据。</p><div class=\"ifm-meta-line\"><span class=\"ifm-meta-item\"><svg class=\"ifm-meta-icon\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 7.5 12 3l8 4.5v9L12 21l-8-4.5z\"></path><path d=\"m4 7.5 8 4.5 8-4.5M12 12v9\"></path></svg>Package <code>dji.v5.manager.interfaces</code><button class=\"ifm-mini-copy\" type=\"button\" data-copy=\"dji.v5.manager.interfaces\" aria-label=\"复制包名\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M16 8V6a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v8a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h2\"></path></svg></button></span><span class=\"ifm-meta-item\"><svg class=\"ifm-meta-icon\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"></circle><path d=\"M12 7v5l3 2\"></path></svg>Android · Java / Kotlin</span></div><h5 id=\"描述：\" style=\"display: none;\">描述：</h5>\n<p style=\"display: none;\"><font color=\"#666\">SDK互联互通管理类。可通过此类建立MSDK和PSDK设备之间连接的管道，用于MSDK和PSDK设备之间传输数据。 <br><br><code><i>MSDK 5.3.0开始支持</i></code></font></p><font color=\"#666\">\n<div class=\"ifm-members-section\" id=\"ifm-members-nav\"><div class=\"ifm-section-head\"><h2>成员</h2><span class=\"ifm-section-note\"><span class=\"ifm-count\">12</span> 个成员</span></div><div class=\"ifm-member-tools\"><div class=\"ifm-member-search\"><svg class=\"ifm-search-icon\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"7\"></circle><path d=\"m20 20-3.4-3.4\"></path></svg><input type=\"search\" id=\"ifm-search\" placeholder=\"按名称、参数或描述筛选\" aria-label=\"筛选成员\"><button class=\"ifm-search-clear\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"清空搜索\" hidden=\"\"><svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 6l12 12M18 6 6 18\"></path></svg></button></div><div class=\"ifm-filter-group\"><button class=\"ifm-filter-btn\" data-filter=\"all\" aria-pressed=\"true\">全部</button><button class=\"ifm-filter-btn\" data-filter=\"listener\">监听</button><button class=\"ifm-filter-btn\" data-filter=\"method\">方法</button><button class=\"ifm-filter-btn\" data-filter=\"enum\">枚举</button><button class=\"ifm-filter-btn\" data-filter=\"class\">Class</button></div></div><div class=\"ifm-member-groups\" id=\"ifm-groups\"><div class=\"ifm-member-group\" data-group=\"listener\"><div class=\"ifm-member-group-head\"><h3>监听</h3><span class=\"ifm-member-count\">3</span></div><div class=\"ifm-member-list\"><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"ipipelinemanager_addpipelineconnectionlistener_inline\" data-category=\"listener\" data-search=\"addpipelineconnectionlistener 设置sdk互联互通连接监听器。你需要调用connectpipeline连接管道。当管道连接成功以后，可以通过此监听器获取连接事件。\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">method</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">addPipelineConnectionListener</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">设置SDK互联互通连接监听器。你需要调用connectPipeline连接管道。当管道连接成功以后，可以通过此监听器获取连接事件。</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"ipipelinemanager_removepipelineconnectionlistener_inline\" data-category=\"listener\" data-search=\"removepipelineconnectionlistener 移除sdk互联互通连接监听器。\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">method</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">removePipelineConnectionListener</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">移除SDK互联互通连接监听器。</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"ipipelinemanager_clearallpipelineconnectionlistener_inline\" data-category=\"listener\" data-search=\"clearallpipelineconnectionlistener 移除所有sdk互联互通连接监听器。\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">method</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">clearAllPipelineConnectionListener</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">移除所有SDK互联互通连接监听器。</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button></div></div><div class=\"ifm-member-group\" data-group=\"method\"><div class=\"ifm-member-group-head\"><h3>方法</h3><span class=\"ifm-member-count\">3</span></div><div class=\"ifm-member-list\"><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"ipipelinemanager_getpipelines_inline\" data-category=\"method\" data-search=\"getpipelines 获取所有已连接的管道实例映射表。映射表中的键是已连接的psdk设备的管道id，映射表中的值是管道实例对象。成功建立管道连接后，将创建一个管道对象并将其放置在映射表中。当调用disconnectpipeline时，过期的管道将从映射表中删除。\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">method</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">getPipelines</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">获取所有已连接的管道实例映射表。映射表中的键是已连接的PSDK设备的管道ID，映射表中的值是管道实例对象。成功建立管道连接后，将创建一个管道对象并将其放置在映射表中。当调用disconnectPipeline时，过期的管道将从映射表中删除。</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"ipipelinemanager_connectpipeline_inline\" data-category=\"method\" data-search=\"connectpipeline 使用管道id建立管道连接。成功连接后可通过添加addpipelineconnectionlistener监听器获取管道实例。你也可以调用getpipelines同步获取所有已连接的管道列表。\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">method</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">connectPipeline</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">使用管道ID建立管道连接。成功连接后可通过添加addPipelineConnectionListener监听器获取管道实例。你也可以调用getPipelines同步获取所有已连接的管道列表。</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"ipipelinemanager_disconnectpipeline_inline\" data-category=\"method\" data-search=\"disconnectpipeline 断开与psdk设备的管道连接。如果成功断开连接，则管道实例将从管道映射表中删除，否则将返回错误信息。\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">method</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">disconnectPipeline</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">断开与PSDK设备的管道连接。如果成功断开连接，则管道实例将从管道映射表中删除，否则将返回错误信息。</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button></div></div><div class=\"ifm-member-group\" data-group=\"enum\"><div class=\"ifm-member-group-head\"><h3>枚举</h3><span class=\"ifm-member-count\">3</span></div><div class=\"ifm-member-list\"><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"value_mop_enum_pipelinestate_inline\" data-category=\"enum\" data-search=\"pipelinestate 管道连接状态。\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">enum</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">PipelineState</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">管道连接状态。</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"value_mop_enum_pipelinedevicetype_inline\" data-category=\"enum\" data-search=\"pipelinedevicetype 管道设备类型。\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">enum</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">PipelineDeviceType</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">管道设备类型。</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"value_mop_enum_transmissioncontroltype_inline\" data-category=\"enum\" data-search=\"transmissioncontroltype 管道传输控制类型。\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">enum</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">TransmissionControlType</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">管道传输控制类型。</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button></div></div><div class=\"ifm-member-group\" data-group=\"class\"><div class=\"ifm-member-group-head\"><h3>Class</h3><span class=\"ifm-member-count\">3</span></div><div class=\"ifm-member-list\"><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"ipipelinemanager_pipeline_inline\" data-category=\"class\" data-search=\"pipeline 管道类，可实现对管道的数据读取和写入。\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">class</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">Pipeline</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">管道类，可实现对管道的数据读取和写入。</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"ipipelinemanager_dataresult_inline\" data-category=\"class\" data-search=\"dataresult 管道读写结果类。可以获取管道读取和写入以后的结果状态。\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">class</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">DataResult</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">管道读写结果类。可以获取管道读取和写入以后的结果状态。</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button><button class=\"ifm-member-row\" type=\"button\" data-target=\"ipipelinemanager_pipelineconnectionlistener_inline\" data-category=\"class\" data-search=\"pipelineconnectionlistener sdk互联互通连接监听器。\"><span class=\"ifm-member-badge\">class</span><span class=\"ifm-member-name\">PipelineConnectionListener</span><span class=\"ifm-member-desc\">SDK互联互通连接监听器。</span><span class=\"ifm-member-arrow\">›</span></button></div></div></div><div class=\"ifm-empty-state\" id=\"ifm-empty\" style=\"display:none\">没有匹配的成员，请尝试更短的关键词。</div></div>\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"ipipelinemanager_addpipelineconnectionlistener\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">method</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a class=\"trigger\" href=\"#ipipelinemanager_addpipelineconnectionlistener_inline\">addPipelineConnectionListener</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"ipipelinemanager_addpipelineconnectionlistener_inline\" <blockquote=\"\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">method</span><h3>addPipelineConnectionListener</h3><span class=\"ifm-badge ifm-since-badge\">Since MSDK 5.3.0</span></div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"highlight java ifm-signature-figure\" data-jv-colored=\"1\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"jv-keyword\">void</span> <span class=\"jv-method\">addPipelineConnectionListener</span><span class=\"params\"><span class=\"jv-punct\">(</span><span class=\"jv-type\">PipelineConnectionListener</span> <span class=\"jv-param\">listener</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">)</span></span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\" style=\"display: none;\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>包：</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">dji.v5.manager.interfaces</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><font color=\"#666\">设置SDK互联互通连接监听器。你需要调用<code><a href=\"IPipelineManager.html#ipipelinemanager_connectpipeline\">connectPipeline</a></code>连接管道。当管道连接成功以后，可以通过此监听器获取连接事件。</font></p><font color=\"#666\">\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading\">参数</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table\"><thead><tr><th>名称</th><th>类型</th><th>说明</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>listener</code></td><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><a href=\"IPipelineManager_PipelineConnectionListener.html#ipipelinemanager_pipelineconnectionlistener\"><span class=\"jv-type\">PipelineConnectionListener</span></a> </code></span></td><td>SDK互联互通连接监听器。</td></tr></tbody></table></font></div><font color=\"#666\">\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"ipipelinemanager_removepipelineconnectionlistener\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">method</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a class=\"trigger\" href=\"#ipipelinemanager_removepipelineconnectionlistener_inline\">removePipelineConnectionListener</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"ipipelinemanager_removepipelineconnectionlistener_inline\" <blockquote=\"\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">method</span><h3>removePipelineConnectionListener</h3><span class=\"ifm-badge ifm-since-badge\">Since MSDK 5.3.0</span></div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"highlight java ifm-signature-figure\" data-jv-colored=\"1\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"jv-keyword\">void</span> <span class=\"jv-method\">removePipelineConnectionListener</span><span class=\"params\"><span class=\"jv-punct\">(</span><span class=\"jv-type\">PipelineConnectionListener</span> <span class=\"jv-param\">listener</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">)</span></span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\" style=\"display: none;\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>包：</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">dji.v5.manager.interfaces</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><font color=\"#666\">移除SDK互联互通连接监听器。</font></p><font color=\"#666\">\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading\">参数</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table\"><thead><tr><th>名称</th><th>类型</th><th>说明</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>listener</code></td><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><a href=\"IPipelineManager_PipelineConnectionListener.html#ipipelinemanager_pipelineconnectionlistener\"><span class=\"jv-type\">PipelineConnectionListener</span></a> </code></span></td><td>SDK互联互通连接监听器。</td></tr></tbody></table></font></div><font color=\"#666\">\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"ipipelinemanager_clearallpipelineconnectionlistener\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">method</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a class=\"trigger\" href=\"#ipipelinemanager_clearallpipelineconnectionlistener_inline\">clearAllPipelineConnectionListener</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"ipipelinemanager_clearallpipelineconnectionlistener_inline\" <blockquote=\"\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">method</span><h3>clearAllPipelineConnectionListener</h3><span class=\"ifm-badge ifm-since-badge\">Since MSDK 5.3.0</span></div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"highlight java ifm-signature-figure\" data-jv-colored=\"1\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"jv-keyword\">void</span> <span class=\"jv-method\">clearAllPipelineConnectionListener</span><span class=\"params\"><span class=\"jv-punct\">(</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">)</span></span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\" style=\"display: none;\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>包：</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">dji.v5.manager.interfaces</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><font color=\"#666\">移除所有SDK互联互通连接监听器。</font></p><font color=\"#666\">\n</font></div><font color=\"#666\">\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"ipipelinemanager_getpipelines\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">method</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a class=\"trigger\" href=\"#ipipelinemanager_getpipelines_inline\">getPipelines</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"ipipelinemanager_getpipelines_inline\" <blockquote=\"\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">method</span><h3>getPipelines</h3><span class=\"ifm-badge ifm-since-badge\">Since MSDK 5.3.0</span></div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"highlight java ifm-signature-figure\" data-jv-colored=\"1\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"jv-type\">Map</span><wbr><span class=\"jv-punct\">&lt;</span><span class=\"jv-type\">Integer</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">,</span> <wbr><span class=\"jv-type\">Pipeline</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"jv-method\">getPipelines</span><span class=\"params\"><span class=\"jv-punct\">(</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">)</span></span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\" style=\"display: none;\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>包：</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">dji.v5.manager.interfaces</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><font color=\"#666\">获取所有已连接的管道实例映射表。映射表中的键是已连接的PSDK设备的管道ID，映射表中的值是管道实例对象。成功建立管道连接后，将创建一个管道对象并将其放置在映射表中。当调用<code><a href=\"IPipelineManager.html#ipipelinemanager_disconnectpipeline\">disconnectPipeline</a></code>时，过期的管道将从映射表中删除。</font></p><font color=\"#666\">\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading ifm-return-heading\">返回值</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table ifm-return-table\"><thead><tr><th>类型</th><th>说明</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><span class=\"jv-type\">Map</span><wbr><span class=\"jv-punct\">&lt;</span><span class=\"jv-type\">Integer</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">,</span> <wbr><a href=\"IPipelineManager_Pipeline.html#ipipelinemanager_pipeline\"><span class=\"jv-type\">Pipeline</span></a><span class=\"jv-punct\">&gt;</span></code></span></td><td>返回所有已连接的管道实例映射表。</td></tr></tbody></table></font></div><font color=\"#666\">\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"ipipelinemanager_connectpipeline\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">method</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a class=\"trigger\" href=\"#ipipelinemanager_connectpipeline_inline\">connectPipeline</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"ipipelinemanager_connectpipeline_inline\" <blockquote=\"\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">method</span><h3>connectPipeline</h3><span class=\"ifm-badge ifm-since-badge\">Since MSDK 5.3.0</span></div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"highlight java ifm-signature-figure\" data-jv-colored=\"1\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"jv-type\">IDJIError</span> <span class=\"jv-method\">connectPipeline</span><span class=\"params\"><span class=\"jv-punct\">(</span><span class=\"jv-keyword\">int</span> <span class=\"jv-param\">pipelineId</span>, <span class=\"jv-type\">PipelineDeviceType</span> <span class=\"jv-param\">deviceType</span>, <span class=\"jv-type\">TransmissionControlType</span> <span class=\"jv-param\">transmissionControlType</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">)</span></span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\" style=\"display: none;\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>包：</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">dji.v5.manager.interfaces</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><font color=\"#666\">使用管道ID建立管道连接。成功连接后可通过添加<code><a href=\"IPipelineManager.html#ipipelinemanager_addpipelineconnectionlistener\">addPipelineConnectionListener</a></code>监听器获取管道实例。你也可以调用<code><a href=\"IPipelineManager.html#ipipelinemanager_getpipelines\">getPipelines</a></code>同步获取所有已连接的管道列表。</font></p><font color=\"#666\">\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading\">参数</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table\"><thead><tr><th>名称</th><th>类型</th><th>说明</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>pipelineId</code></td><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><span class=\"jv-keyword\">int</span> </code></span></td><td>管道ID，此ID需要跟PSDK负载开发者进行协商。</td></tr><tr><td><code>deviceType</code></td><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><a href=\"IPipelineManager.html#value_mop_enum_pipelinedevicetype\"><span class=\"jv-type\">PipelineDeviceType</span></a> </code></span></td><td>设备类型，可设置ONBOARD或者PAYLOAD类型。</td></tr><tr><td><code>transmissionControlType</code></td><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><a href=\"IPipelineManager.html#value_mop_enum_transmissioncontroltype\"><span class=\"jv-type\">TransmissionControlType</span></a> </code></span></td><td>传输控制类型，可设置可靠传输类型或者非可靠传输类型。</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading ifm-return-heading\">返回值</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table ifm-return-table\"><thead><tr><th>类型</th><th>说明</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><a href=\"../DJIError/DJIError.html#djierror\"><span class=\"jv-type\">IDJIError</span></a></code></span></td><td>如果连接管道成功返回NULL，如果连接管道失败则会返回相应的错误码。</td></tr></tbody></table></font></div><font color=\"#666\">\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"ipipelinemanager_disconnectpipeline\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">method</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a class=\"trigger\" href=\"#ipipelinemanager_disconnectpipeline_inline\">disconnectPipeline</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"ipipelinemanager_disconnectpipeline_inline\" <blockquote=\"\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">method</span><h3>disconnectPipeline</h3><span class=\"ifm-badge ifm-since-badge\">Since MSDK 5.3.0</span></div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"highlight java ifm-signature-figure\" data-jv-colored=\"1\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"jv-type\">IDJIError</span> <span class=\"jv-method\">disconnectPipeline</span><span class=\"params\"><span class=\"jv-punct\">(</span><span class=\"jv-keyword\">int</span> <span class=\"jv-param\">pipelineId</span>, <span class=\"jv-type\">PipelineDeviceType</span> <span class=\"jv-param\">deviceType</span>, <span class=\"jv-type\">TransmissionControlType</span> <span class=\"jv-param\">transmissionControlType</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">)</span></span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\" style=\"display: none;\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>包：</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">dji.v5.manager.interfaces</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><font color=\"#666\">断开与PSDK设备的管道连接。如果成功断开连接，则管道实例将从管道映射表中删除，否则将返回错误信息。</font></p><font color=\"#666\">\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading\">参数</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table\"><thead><tr><th>名称</th><th>类型</th><th>说明</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>pipelineId</code></td><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><span class=\"jv-keyword\">int</span> </code></span></td><td>管道ID，从已连接的管道实例中获取。</td></tr><tr><td><code>deviceType</code></td><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><a href=\"IPipelineManager.html#value_mop_enum_pipelinedevicetype\"><span class=\"jv-type\">PipelineDeviceType</span></a> </code></span></td><td>设备类型，从已连接的管道实例中获取。</td></tr><tr><td><code>transmissionControlType</code></td><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><a href=\"IPipelineManager.html#value_mop_enum_transmissioncontroltype\"><span class=\"jv-type\">TransmissionControlType</span></a> </code></span></td><td>传输控制类型，从已连接的管道实例中获取。</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading ifm-return-heading\">返回值</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table ifm-return-table\"><thead><tr><th>类型</th><th>说明</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ifm-type-scroll\"><code data-jv-colored=\"1\"><a href=\"../DJIError/DJIError.html#djierror\"><span class=\"jv-type\">IDJIError</span></a></code></span></td><td>如果断开管道成功返回NULL，如果断开管道失败则会返回相应的错误码。</td></tr></tbody></table></font></div><font color=\"#666\">\n<h5 id=\"Related\">Related:</h5>\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"ipipelinemanager_pipeline\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">class</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a href=\"IPipelineManager_Pipeline.html\">Pipeline</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc class-inline-doc offline-class-inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"ipipelinemanager_pipeline_inline\" data-class-href=\"IPipelineManager_Pipeline.html\" data-class-name=\"Pipeline\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">class</span><h3>Pipeline</h3><span class=\"ifm-badge ifm-since-badge\">Since MSDK 5.3.0</span></div><figure class=\"highlight java ifm-signature-figure\" data-jv-colored=\"1\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"jv-keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"jv-class\">Pipeline</span></span></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure><p><font color=\"#666\">管道类，可实现对管道的数据读取和写入。</font></p><p></p></div><div class=\"api-row\" id=\"ipipelinemanager_dataresult\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">class</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a href=\"IPipelineManager_DataResult.html\">DataResult</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc class-inline-doc offline-class-inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"ipipelinemanager_dataresult_inline\" data-class-href=\"IPipelineManager_DataResult.html\" data-class-name=\"DataResult\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">class</span><h3>DataResult</h3><span class=\"ifm-badge ifm-since-badge\">Since MSDK 5.3.0</span></div><figure class=\"highlight java ifm-signature-figure\" data-jv-colored=\"1\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"jv-keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"jv-class\">DataResult</span></span></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure><p><font color=\"#666\">管道读写结果类。可以获取管道读取和写入以后的结果状态。</font></p><p></p></div><div class=\"api-row\" id=\"value_mop_enum_pipelinestate\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">enum</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a class=\"trigger\" href=\"#value_mop_enum_pipelinestate_inline\">PipelineState</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"value_mop_enum_pipelinestate_inline\" <blockquote=\"\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">enum</span><h3>PipelineState</h3><span class=\"ifm-badge ifm-since-badge\">Since MSDK 5.3.0</span></div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"highlight java\" style=\"display: none;\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">enum</span> <span class=\"title class_\">PipelineState</span> <span class=\"keyword\">implements</span> <span class=\"title class_\">JNIProguardKeepTag</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\" style=\"display: none;\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>包：</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">dji.sdk.keyvalue.value.mop</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><font color=\"#666\">管道连接状态。</font></p><font color=\"#666\">\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading\">枚举成员</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table ifm-enum-table\"><thead><tr><th>名称</th><th>说明</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code><font color=\"#70BF41\"><a href=\"#value_mop_enum_pipelinestate_connected_inline\"></a>CONNECTED</font></code></td><td>管道已连接。</td></tr><tr><td><code><font color=\"#70BF41\"><a href=\"#value_mop_enum_pipelinestate_disconnected_inline\"></a>DISCONNECTED</font></code></td><td>管道已断开。</td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n</font></div><font color=\"#666\">\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"value_mop_enum_pipelinedevicetype\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">enum</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a class=\"trigger\" href=\"#value_mop_enum_pipelinedevicetype_inline\">PipelineDeviceType</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"value_mop_enum_pipelinedevicetype_inline\" <blockquote=\"\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">enum</span><h3>PipelineDeviceType</h3><span class=\"ifm-badge ifm-since-badge\">Since MSDK 5.3.0</span></div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"highlight java\" style=\"display: none;\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">enum</span> <span class=\"title class_\">PipelineDeviceType</span> <span class=\"keyword\">implements</span> <span class=\"title class_\">JNIProguardKeepTag</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\" style=\"display: none;\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>包：</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">dji.sdk.keyvalue.value.mop</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><font color=\"#666\">管道设备类型。</font></p><font color=\"#666\">\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading\">枚举成员</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-table ifm-enum-table\"><thead><tr><th>名称</th><th>说明</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code><font color=\"#70BF41\"><a href=\"#value_mop_enum_pipelinedevicetype_onboard_inline\"></a>ONBOARD</font></code></td><td>Onboard类型。</td></tr><tr><td><code><font color=\"#70BF41\"><a href=\"#value_mop_enum_pipelinedevicetype_payload_inline\"></a>PAYLOAD</font></code></td><td>Payload类型。</td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n</font></div><font color=\"#666\">\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"value_mop_enum_transmissioncontroltype\"><div cla